help/equivI (prodcert X6/1 X6/2) F G (x2 \ prodcert (X3/1 x2) (X3/2 x2)) (x4 \ prodcert (X5/1 x4) (X5/2 x4)) :- help/equivI X6/1 F G X3/1 X5/1 , help/equivI X6/2 F G X3/2 X5/2.

